{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Look.</b> Rabbi Moses said: they are in the imperative mood. In my opinion: הבט is a verbal noun, like והצל תציל, and ראה as well is a verbal noun, on the pattern of למען היה לה ברק."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 142, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:42:31.579272821Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}